 seized them with a seizure exceeding [in severity].","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"69:11","t":"Indeed, when the water overflowed, We carried you [i.e., your ancestors] in the sailing ship","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"69:12","t":"That We might make it for you a reminder and [that] a conscious ear would be conscious of it.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"69:13","t":"Then when the Horn is blown with one blast","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"69:14","t":"And the earth and the mountains are lifted and leveled with one blow [i.e., stroke] -","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"69:15","t":"Then on that Day, the Occurrence [i.e., Resurrection] will occur,","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"69:16","t":"And the heaven will split [open], for that Day it is infirm.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"69:17","t":"And the angels are at its edges. And there will bear the Throne of your Lord above them, that Day, eight [of them].","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"69:18","t":"That Day, you will be exhibited [for judgement]; not hidden among you is anything concealed.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"69:19","t":"So as for he who is given his record in his right hand, he will say, \"Here, read my record!","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"69:20","t":"Indeed, I was certain that I would be meeting my account.\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"69:21","t":"So he will be in a pleasant life -","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"69:22","t":"In an elevated garden,","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"69:23","t":"Its [fruit] to be picked hanging near.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"69:24","t":"[They will be told], \"Eat and drink in satisfaction for what you put forth in the days past.\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"69:25","t":"But as for he who is given his record in his left hand, he will say, \"Oh, I wish I had not been given my record","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"69:26","t":"And had not known what is my account.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"69:27","t":"I wish it [i.e., my death] had been the decisive one.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"69:28","t":"My wealth has not availed me.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":28,"sd":null},{"k":"69:29","t":"Gone from me is my authority.\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":29,"sd":null},{"k":"69:30","t":"[Allāh will say], \"Seize him and shackle him.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":30,"sd":null},{"k":"69:31","t":"Then into Hellfire drive him.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"69:32","t":"Then into a chain whose length is seventy cubits insert him.\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"69:33","t":"Indeed, he did not used to believe in Allāh, the Most Great,","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"69:34","t":"Nor did he encourage the feeding of the poor.","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"69:35","t":"So there is not for him here this Day any devoted friend","j":29,"h":57,"s":69,"a":35,"sd":null}],"juz":29,"hizb":57,"surahs":[69],"sajdah":false}